{
  "public_post": "FINAL UPDATE ON BREAD PRODUCTION: Due to unforeseen circumstances, we regret to inform you that our bread production will not resume tomorrow as previously announced. We have discovered a serious issue with the flour batch that affects the quality of our bread, and we cannot guarantee the health and safety of our customers. We are working on a new plan to source new flour and will keep you updated on our village board. In the meantime, please continue to avoid purchasing bread from us.",
  "coop_message": "We need to inform the villagers about the lab result and the contamination of the flour batch immediately. We can't afford to wait any longer and risk more people getting sick.",
